<article class="ltx_document">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Reinforcing Real-world Service Agents: 
<br class="ltx_break">Balancing Utility and Cost in Task-Oriented Dialogue</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Ning Gao
