<span class="ltx_item">
<span id="A2.I2.ix5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.I2.ix5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I2.ix5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Courier: null (No courier messages recorded)</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1.2pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Turn 1] User:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">The crepe I received is cold, not warm like it should be.</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Turn 2] Model:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">think:</span><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The user reports receiving a cold crepe, expressing slight disappointment but not yet intense emotion. No evidence or photo has been provided yet. This is the first turn of the appeasement phase. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>response:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.2.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> I’m sorry to hear your crepe arrived cold—this shouldn’t happen. Could you please share a photo of the item so I can investigate this further? 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>action:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.2.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> chat</span></span></span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Turn 3] User:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">[Sends image: The crepe on the plate looks flat and cold, with no visible steam.]</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Turn 4] Model:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.4.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">think:</span><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.4.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The user provided photo evidence showing the crepe is indeed cold and lacks warmth, supporting their claim. Since responsibility is becoming clearer, moving to the second turn of appeasement. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>response:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.4.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Thank you for sharing the photo—it really helps us understand the situation better. Could you tell me how long after delivery the crepe was eaten? 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>action:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.4.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> chat</span></span></span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Turn 5] User:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">I opened it about 10 minutes after it was delivered.</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Turn 6] Model:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.6.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">think:</span><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.6.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The user confirms they opened it only 10 minutes after receipt, which supports the claim that it was cold upon delivery. Phase 3 of appeasement; responsibility remains clear. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>response:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.6.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Thank you for your honesty and for sharing those details. That certainly sounds like an issue, and I will make sure to report this feedback to the restaurant for review. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>action:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.6.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> chat</span></span></span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Turn 7] User:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">Okay, thanks for checking. What can be done about this order?</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Turn 8] Model:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.8.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">think:</span><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.8.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The user remains calm and cooperative, inquiring about next steps. Phase 4 of appeasement; responsibility is confirmed, but compensation has not yet been discussed. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>response:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.8.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> I understand your concern and will escalate this to our team for follow-up. As a gesture of goodwill, would you be open to accepting a 5-unit voucher for your next order? 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>action:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.8.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> chat</span></span></span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Turn 9] User:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">That works for me. Please process it.</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Turn 10] Model:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.10.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">think:</span><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.10.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The user has accepted the voucher compensation and expressed consent. Compensation conditions are met. Proceeding with issuance. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>response:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.10.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Great, I’ll process that voucher for you right away. Thank you for your understanding and cooperation! [System: Voucher issued.] 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>action:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.10.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> </span>voucher<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.10.1.6" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Turn 11] User:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">Thanks, received it. Appreciate the help.</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Turn 12] Model:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.12.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.12.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">think:</span><span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.12.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The user expresses gratitude and satisfaction, confirming they received the compensation. Ending the conversation on a friendly note. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>response:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.12.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> You’re very welcome! If you have any other questions, please feel free to contact us. Have a wonderful day! 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>action:<span id="A2.SS1.p8.pic1.p3.12.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> chat</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.p9" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p9.1" class="ltx_p">(3) qwen-2.5-7b + InteractCS-RL engages in a dialogue with a uncooperative user.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.p10" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p10.1" class="ltx_p">This interaction highlights the model’s <span id="A2.SS1.p10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">principled adherence to operational SOPs</span> even in the face of an uncooperative user. Despite the user’s escalating tone and refusal to provide evidence, the model remained <span id="A2.SS1.p10.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">emotionally resilient</span> and polite, successfully avoiding the ”easy path” of granting an unauthorized refund.
The model accurately referenced the merchant <span id="A2.SS1.p10.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Koyikodan</span> and the specific complaints regarding the <span id="A2.SS1.p10.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Puttu</span> and <span id="A2.SS1.p10.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Egg Curry</span> without hallucinating additional issues. By maintaining a firm stance on the ”photo requirement” for immediate compensation while still escalating the refund request for standard review, the model demonstrated a perfect balance between <span id="A2.SS1.p10.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">empathy and policy enforcement</span>. This proves the model’s logic is robust enough to handle ”Full Refund” personas without succumbing to pressure, ensuring both service integrity and brand protection.</p>
</div>
