<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.SS1.p11.pic1.p2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The user is highly resistant to standard procedures, refuses to provide photo evidence, and insists on a full refund due to unsure reasons. Their tone is blunt and impatient.</span></span></span></span>
</span>
